  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B7 0D}这里的门也被封住了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_400.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5E 0B}是需要巡礼的门。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_400.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}上面写着的巡礼顺序是\n{F2 01 03 01}“朱雀、玄武、青龙、白虎”{F2 01 01 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_400.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 07 01 01 01 01 01 F5 02}{F5 86 0F 01 07 01 65 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 0B}那扇门后面……\n能感觉到某种奇妙的气息。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_400.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}像是令人紧绷的寂静……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_400.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 07 01 01 01 01 01 F5 02}{F5 86 07 01 01 01 65 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}和之前的楼层完全不同……\n守卫会不会就在那扇门后面？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_400.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 86 29 01 08 01 02 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C2 11}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_400.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0F 01 02 01 65 01 02 01}{F5 86 07 01 0D 01 65 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}啊，还有，这一层好像\n分成了{F2 01 03 01}４个区域{F2 01 01 01}。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_400.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我能感觉到４座鸟居，\n应该是{F2 01 03 01}每个区域各有１座{F2 01 01 01}。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_400.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 65 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}从大家所在的位置，\n似乎也能看到４扇门……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_400.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我想每扇门\n都通往一座鸟居。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_400.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0E 01 09 01 02 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4E 0A}原来如此……\n４扇门后各有一座鸟居啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_400.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}巡礼顺序是\n{F2 01 03 01}“朱雀、玄武、青龙、白虎”{F2 01 01 01}，\n但哪扇门通向哪座鸟居……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_400.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0072",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……接下来就交给身为队长的你了。\n这里是最后一层。\n和之前一样，拜托你了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_400.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 08 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这里真的就是终点了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_400.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……首先是{F2 01 03 01}“朱雀”{F2 01 01 01}的鸟居吧。\n加油吧，{F1 81}。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
]